        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a forest at night, and the hunt begins. Carefully plan your pack’s next move to avoid being seen, smelled or heard. Hunt enough prey to survive the next month, and develop your pack and tactics throughout changing seasons. You’ll fail – but learn from your mistakes and prepare for the next run!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NAVIGATE A PROCEDURALLY GENERATED FOREST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950740/extras/9581bfee4841576188edcae5ad92e17b.avif?t=1761235537\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is unique and presents new challenges. Use all the advantages provided by the terrain shape and other animals' positions and paths. Observe, wait, and learn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAREFULLY PLAN TRAPS TO CATCH PREY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950740/extras/a65086fbed9d9bc0f017844f4cda963f.avif?t=1761235537\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rushing will give you nothing; surround your prey, take into account other animals, use all of your wolves and terrain advantages at the right moment. Be patient.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AVOID OR KILL OTHER ANIMALS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950740/extras/96061c597550385b167cf53fc865b150.avif?t=1761235537\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need meat to survive, but attacking everything in sight will soon prove to be a bad idea. Attack selected animals and avoid others, because they can alarm your prey or even kill your wolves!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEVELOP YOUR PACK THROUGHOUT THE CHANGING SEASONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950740/extras/341fd3dae0295db4bac51f37cde9fa62.avif?t=1761235537\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saving some gathered meat for the worst moments and learning new skills will be equally important. Discover new skills by finishing seasons, and decide what and when will be useful.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >procedurally generated stealth game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >survival roguelite</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >minimalist, atmospheric style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >learning skills and developing the wolf pack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >vastly different seasons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >several different animals to hunt  or avoid</p></li></ul>",
