ass=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950740/extras/341fd3dae0295db4bac51f37cde9fa62.avif?t=1761235537\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saving some gathered meat for the worst moments and learning new skills will be equally important. Discover new skills by finishing seasons, and decide what and when will be useful.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >procedurally generated stealth game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >survival roguelite</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >minimalist, atmospheric style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >learning skills and developing the wolf pack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >vastly different seasons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >several different animals to hunt  or avoid</p></li></ul>",
